    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'12Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2155$10 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'12'24No. 2155/10 - TUESDAY DECEMBER 24, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE BUTTALA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1)(a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Buttala Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Not attending threeconsecutive meetings without permission ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichHerathmudiyanselage Chinthaka Sampath Bandara the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1)(a) ofthe aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that No. 01 Pelwaththa of Buttala Pradeshiya Sabha who belongsto such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall bedeclared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Indrasena Liyana Arachchi to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Indika Gayan Pathirana, Returning Officer of the Buttala Pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that IndrasenaLiyana Arachchi was elected as the member of the No. 01 Pelwaththa of Buttala Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nINDIKA GAYAN PATHIRANA,Returning Officer,Buttala Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Moneragala,23rd December, 2019.\n\n01 - 298\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
