    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'12Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2155$35 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 28 jeks fikiqrdod - 2019'12'28No. 2155/35 - SATURDAY DECEMBER 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE POLGAHAWELAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of being ceasedto be member of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance, the recognized political partyto which Nishshanka Dhanushka Rathnajeewa Pushpa Kumara the member belonged, was required by me under Section66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member if United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance who belongsto such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall bedeclared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Balasooriya Mudiyanselage Anura Kumara Balasooriya to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, Returning Officer of the Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatBalasooriya Mudiyanselage Anura Kumara Balasooriya was selected as the member of the Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nGAMALATHGE DILIP NISHANTHA,Returning Officer,Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kurunegala,27th December, 2019.\n\n01 - 399\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
